00:28:12.444 --> 00:28:14.361
<i>♪ We want the fury. ♪</i>

307
00:28:14.987 --> 00:28:18.405
In college, I never thought a girl
like you would join the police force.

308
00:28:18.865 --> 00:28:20.823
- Your peppers.
- Thanks.

